#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id= 
@schoolId=1

###

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users?page=1&limit=10  HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.garcia@ejemplo.com",
  "isVerified": false,
  "fullName": "Carlos",
  "fullLastName": "García López",
  "photoUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/fotos/carlosgarcia.jpg",
