###

### Update user profile
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/{{id}}/profile HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria.lopez@est.una.ac.cr",
  "fullName": "María Actualizada",
  "fullLastName": "López Actualizada",
  "primaryPhone": "+50689998888"
}

###

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
